## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design lightweight, runtime routing based on language and data-safety in prompt-driven tooling.

## Key Concepts
- Lightweight language detection
- Prompt routing to modules
- Safe defaults and edge-case handling
- Minimal, testable Python prototype

## Code Example
